// Generated by maddy. Edits will be overwritten.

// maddy slide system.
//
// One self-contained file, by necessity: a generated document is compiled with
// the author's Markdown directory as its root, so it cannot import siblings —
// they are not there. The separation the design asks for is kept as distinct
// dictionaries instead of distinct files.
//
//   palettes   colour only, through one semantic token interface
//   styles     typography, spacing and composition, with no colour of their own
//   sizes      the base body size the whole scale derives from
//   ratios     page geometry
//
// A style names only semantic tokens, so any style composes with any palette.

// ============================================================ palettes

// Palettes: colour only. Every palette exposes the same semantic tokens, so a
// style can reference `palette.primary` and never know which one it has.
//
//   primary       the dominant colour: titles, strong headings
//   primary-dark  a deeper step, for section slides and large fills
//   secondary     supporting colour, for subdued structural marks
//   accent        used sparingly: eyebrows, markers, one highlighted number
//   background    the page; never pure white, never pure black
//   surface       a half-step from background, for code and callouts
//   text          body text; a very dark desaturated relative of primary
//   text-muted    captions, footers, subtitles — must stay readable
//   border        rules and hairlines; quieter than text

#let midnight = (
